# Mutation plan for GET /api/v4/teams/{team_id}/channels/recommended
# (getRecommendedChannelsForTeam).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/recommended-channels.plan
#
# The reachable surface is a permission check and three bytes, so the mutations are about exactly
# that: the scope the permission is asked at, that the id is validated first, that a licensed
# installation is forwarded rather than answered, and that the empty answer is `[]` and not `null`
# — the same distinction `getUserAudits` resolves the other way.
#
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

